WEBVTT

00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:02.329
Depression can have a lot
of different symptoms:

00:01:02.371 --> 00:01:03.412
a low mood,

00:01:03.454 --> 00:01:05.704
loss of interest in things
you'd normally enjoy,

00:01:05.746 --> 00:01:09.913
changes in appetite, feeling 
worthless or excessively guilty,

00:01:09.954 --> 00:01:12.329
sleeping either too much or too little,

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:15.288
poor concentration,
restlessness or slowness,

00:01:15.329 --> 00:01:18.454
loss of energy,
or recurrent thoughts of suicide.

00:01:19.371 --> 00:01:21.954
If you have at least five
of those symptoms,

00:01:21.996 --> 00:01:24.538
according to psychiatric guidelines,

00:01:24.579 --> 00:01:27.996
you qualify for a diagnosis of depression.

00:01:28.038 --> 00:01:31.246
And it's not just behavioral symptoms.